// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  anima_chat.hexa — pure-hexa port of anima_chat.py v2.3
//
//  PURPOSE
//    Full port of the anima chat library SSOT (933 LoC Python) to pure
//    hexa. This is the chat library half of GOAL.md ★★★★★ mission —
//    "[anima_chat 시스템, anima 모델] 조합" 의 system 측 pure-hexa 전환.
//
//    Reference source: /Users/ghost/core/anima/anima_chat.py
//    Reference tag:    anima_chat-v2.3-markdown-filter (commit c2afa8e9e)
//
//  STATUS (2026-05-12)
//    PARSE-COMPLETE. Helpers (tokenize wrap, interrogative detect, segment
//    parse, stop detect, markdown filter, force-keyword extract) are
//    behaviorally complete. 4-mode generation wires the existing
//    tool/hexa_native/* primitives (engine_ag_nn / gen_modes / byte_tokenizer)
//    + RFC 025/030/031/032/033 builtins via fn-style orchestrator (record +
//    functional API — no class syntax used).
//
//  HEXA EQUIVALENCE MAP (Python -> hexa)
//    safetensors mmap load   -> safetensors_mmap_open / _data_offset /
//                                _read_f32_farr / _read_bf16_to_f32_farr
//                                (RFC 025, RFC 031)
//    bytes -> str            -> bytes_to_str_raw (RFC 030)
//    matmul hot loop         -> farr_matmul (RFC 032)
//    deepcopy + gaussian     -> farr_copy + farr_add_gaussian_noise (RFC 033)
//    byte tokenize           -> tool/hexa_native/byte_tokenizer (Phase 4.2)
//    24L GQA forward         -> tool/hexa_native/engine_ag_nn (Phase 3 + 4.1)
//    4 gen modes             -> tool/hexa_native/gen_modes (Phase 4.3)
//    mitosis hook (future)   -> tool/hexa_native/mitosis_hook (stub)
//    regex (markdown filter) -> regex_findall / regex_search (stdlib)
//    str fns (split/find)    -> regex_findall + char_at + substring
//    Korean POS (KoNLPy Okt) -> Hangul-range char-class filter (TODO[okt])
//    HF auto-download        -> out of scope (TODO[hf]; caller supplies path)
//    pickle .pt ckpt         -> out of scope (TODO[pickle]; safetensors only)
//
//  TODO MARKERS (scope-out items, follow-up cycles)
//    TODO[okt]    : Korean POS tagger equivalent absent in hexa stdlib.
//                   extract_force_keywords falls back to simpler
//                   "[가-힣]{2,}" chunk extraction + heuristic skip-list.
//                   Behavior diverges from Python on multi-noun prompts —
//                   acceptance per F-AC-HEXA-4 below requires that a
//                   single-noun prompt like "사랑이 뭐야?" yields ["사랑"].
//    TODO[hf]     : HF auto-download (huggingface_hub) deferred to
//                   external helper or Vast.ai bootstrap. anima_chat.hexa
//                   only accepts a local on-disk safetensors path.
//    TODO[pickle] : Legacy .pt pickle ckpt path (Python pickle is not
//                   reproducible across hexa runtime). Out of scope —
//                   anima_chat.hexa is safetensors-only.
//    TODO[env]    : env() builtin exists (used for ANIMA_ROOT resolution).
//
//  FALSIFIERS (pre-registered, raw-117 ≥ 5)
//    F-AC-HEXA-1 PARSE          : `hexa parse anima_chat.hexa` returns 0
//    F-AC-HEXA-2 HELPERS        : _markdown_attractor_active /
//                                  _post_strip_markdown_tables /
//                                  _looks_like_interrogative
//                                  give expected booleans on 10+ Python-
//                                  cross-validated cases
//    F-AC-HEXA-3 TOKENIZER      : ByteTokenizer encode/decode round-trip
//                                  (Hangul "안녕" + ASCII "hello" + emoji
//                                  "🌌") byte-exact match
//    F-AC-HEXA-4 FORCE-KEYWORD  : extract_force_keywords on
//                                  "사용자: 사랑이 뭐야? | 도우미: "
//                                  returns ["사랑이"] (Python no-Okt fallback
//                                  parity — Okt would strip "이" particle,
//                                  but the hexa lane has no Okt; this is
//                                  byte-exact with Python's fallback path)
//    F-AC-HEXA-5 MARKDOWN-FILTER: ban-set produced by _markdown_ban_token_ids
//                                  equals {|, -, :, space} ids = {124+3,
//                                  45+3, 58+3, 32+3} = {127, 48, 61, 35}
//    F-AC-HEXA-6 SMOKE-MAIN     : _smoke() exits without abort (helpers
//                                  only; full inference parity is a
//                                  separate cycle)
//
//  COMPLIANCE
